WEBVTT

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:08.390
Our mission is to gather the Seven Mermaid Princesses and seven pearls and summon forth Aqua Regina-sama.

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:11.280
We're feeling a bit relieved since Karen joined our side,

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:15.290
but Karen's twin sister, Noelle, is still trapped in Gaito's lair.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:19.400
But we're never, ever going to lose to them!

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:24.210
All right! Today again with our Pichi Pichi Voices, it's Live Start!

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:07.180
Hey. You'll stay over for the night, won't you, Rina?

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:10.900
Sure. Since it's a holiday, I'll take you up on your offer.

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:16.870
If Rina is staying over, we can talk all night and not have to worry about the time.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:21.650
Although having a good friendship is important, you three shouldn't stay up too late.

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:25.750
That's because I've already prepared for my New Year's first dream.

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:26.910
New Year's first dream?

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:33.250
There is a very old saying in the human world, that the first dream in the new year will come true.

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:36.550
I've already made all the preparations to make my dream come true.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.300
First off, I've got Tarou-chan's photograph.

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:40.800
Next, I've got my Tarou-chan pillow.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:42.650
A Tarou-chan handkerchief...

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:45.600
But none of these compare to my Tarou-chan doll!

00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:51.040
If I keep all of these Tarou-chan items with me when I sleep,

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:53.520
I'm sure that Tarou-chan will be in my dreams.

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:56.970
You're so dedicated to have collected so many items.

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:59.750
Hanon only cares about herself. It's not fair.

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:03.280
I didn't even prepare any Kaito items.

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:07.470
For your first dream of the year, it would be silly to not have prepared anything, Lucia.

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:11.900
These are the little things that will make love blossom.

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:15.750
But it's too pitiful to see you with without anything ready...

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:19.220
How about I teach you some spells so you'll dream of Kaito-kun?

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:22.220
Really? Thanks!

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:25.600
Operation New Year's First Dream

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:31.890
What is it, Maria?

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:33.620
Everyone's been called together like this.

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:35.360
Even Sheshe and Mimi were called.

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:38.190
So, what business do you have with us?

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:40.770
I have a proposal.

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:42.850
I think everyone here agrees with me on this...

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:45.530
We don't want to see Gaito-sama's sad face ever again.

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:50.000
I'm hoping that we can cooperate and capture the remaining Mermaid Princesses.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.470
How does that sound?

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:52.420
I see.

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:54.870
So it's a proposal for us to work together, right?

00:03:55.260 --> 00:04:00.860
It's a good observation, but it doesn't benefit us to fight alongside any of you.

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:01.960
How true.

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:04.800
Did you have to put it so bluntly?

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:07.750
It's a pathetic battle every time,

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:11.810
and you bunch of losers are defeated with a single song from the Mermaid Princesses, right?

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:14.600
What did you say!? I dare you to say that again!

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:17.020
Oh, did I say something wrong?

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:20.230
Oh, no. Never mind.

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:21.330
Fine.

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:24.210
If you come up with a battle tactic that is different from the past,

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:26.530
we can work together for once.

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:30.120
As long as it's a different tactic from the past, huh? We'll agree to that.

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:46.130
It's fantastic to be walking while holding hands with Tarou-chan!

00:04:46.570 --> 00:04:49.830
It's just that whenever I look at Tarou-chan's face, I realize it's not really him.

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:51.020
It makes me very disappointed.

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:53.590
Is there something wrong?

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:57.190
If you keep staring at me like that, I'll get embarrassed, Hanon-san.

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.370
Don't call me "Hanon-san."

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.150
Call me "Hanon."

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:02.570
Hanon.

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:04.390
You're cuter than usual today.

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:05.900
Tarou-chan.

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:09.770
I'm so happy! {added nice fade effect}

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:11.820
Tarou-chan...

00:05:18.140 --> 00:05:19.840
What is it, so early in the morning?

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:21.980
Congratulations!

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:24.130
You've won a wall-mounted plasma TV!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:26.380
I-I won it?

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:28.090
I've waited bitterly for fourteen years,

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:31.880
but I finally got my own wall-mounted plasma TV! {nice fade here too :)}

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:34.600
Plasma TV...

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:45.460
This is the place where you ran up and spoke to me.

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:48.160
That was our first meeting.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:52.580
Ever since I met you, to be honest, I've had something that I always wanted to ask you.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:58.030
In my heart, I've felt that there was something more.

00:05:58.780 --> 00:06:00.920
The mermaid that I met when I was a child,

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:05.340
Lucia, could you be that girl?

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:06.920
Kaito.

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:09.380
You finally realized it.

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:12.840
I'm so happy, Kaito.

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:15.390
But this is only a dream, isn't it?

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:24.520
Hey, Lucia.

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:26.240
How was your first dream?

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:28.470
Did you have the dream where you and Kaito are lovey-dovey together?

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:31.240
Ah, well you can say that.

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:35.500
I dreamed that I was having a seaside date with Tarou-chan.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:40.250
Geez. Even in a dream, Tarou-chan is still a very refined gentleman.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:42.280
So, Rina. What did you dream about?

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.340
I won a wall-mounted plasma TV.

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:48.630
But even though I won it in a dream, I had nothing when I woke up.

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:51.440
It's only natural for that to happen.

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:54.200
Oh well, the first dream is a good start.

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:57.830
It should be okay as long as we continue to hope that our dreams come true.

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:01.900
Who could that be, so early in the morning?

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:07.320
Sorry to bother you.

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:14.630
I am Watanabe from the Boni Music Company.

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:16.790
To be honest, I had a hard time finding this place.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:21.330
Truth is, I've heard a rumor that a mysterious idol group is staying here.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.780
They appear out of nowhere, then disappear immediately after they've finished singing.

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:26.800
It's an amazing idol group.

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:29.550
Did we really stand out that much?

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:32.190
Could it be that you're a scout?

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:33.490
Yes, it's exactly as you say.

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:35.050
In short, I have scouted out all of you.

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:36.760
By all means, please allow my company to debut your group!

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:40.020
L-Lucia-san and the others are going to debut their idol image!?

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:42.620
I've already prepared the schedule for the group's debut.

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:44.520
Without further ado, let's go to the television station!

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:48.630
My time to debut as an idol has finally come.
It's like a dream come true!

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:51.360
Hey, Hanon. We haven't decided whether we're going to agree to this or not.

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:53.270
As long as your debut song is a hit,

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:57.120
I will give you any number of the latest wall-mounted plasma TVs you want.

00:07:57.270 --> 00:07:57.990
Let's go.

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:00.890
Hold on for a moment. Hanon, Rina.

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:01.620
Are you two serious?

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:03.390
Lucia, don't fall behind.

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:05.880
It's disgraceful as performers to be late.

00:08:11.480 --> 00:08:13.220
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:15.110
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:08:15.110 --> 00:08:17.040
Green Pearl Voice!

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:53.780
Kaito, Kaito!

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:55.990
Over here, Kaito.

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:58.910
It's me, it's me.

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:00.870
Lucia.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.410
It seems like you're in a difficult situation.

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:13.080
This time we have to go overseas to shoot a movie scene after it's been finalized.

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:16.630
So I took a day off, to secretly come and see you.

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:19.310
Are you alright? Are you able to cope?

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:20.970
Do they do anything that makes you uncomfortable?

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:24.180
I'm so busy that my body almost can't take it.

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:26.810
But Hanon and Rina are giving their all.

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:28.890
I have to give my best as well.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:30.450
Is that so.

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:31.630
Do your best.

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:34.990
No matter how far away the places you go, I'll always be with you.

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:38.400
Thank you, Kaito.

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:39.550
Let's see...

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:46.250
Next up, we'll have to head outdoors to take care of the party scene.

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:49.520
Kaito, what are you doing right now?

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:50.970
Lucia-san?

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:52.730
Are you listening to me?

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:55.030
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:56.480
I just spaced out a bit.

00:11:56.890 --> 00:12:00.070
So once the preparations for the photo shoot are done, I'll come and pick you up.

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:01.710
Please wait in this room for the time being.

00:12:04.350 --> 00:12:05.520
What is it, Lucia?

00:12:05.970 --> 00:12:07.380
I've just about reached my limit.

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:09.520
Being separated from Kaito...

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:11.620
I can't take it anymore.

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:15.450
You're right. It's already been several days since your last meeting.

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:18.740
I'm also starting to miss my Tarou-chan.

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:20.250
You're right.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:23.630
I can buy ten wall-mounted plasma TVs now...

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:26.520
But it's no fun if I don't have time to watch anything.

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:30.170
Oh well. Not having any free time should be the pride of performers.

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:33.170
I understand what Rina is trying to say.

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:36.090
But we aren't really considered "performers."

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:37.230
Is that so?

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:43.010
If this is a dream, and someone asks me if I want to be a performer when I wake up, I'm turning it down.

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:48.950
Presented by Wasurenai-Fansubs

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:01.370
When the party starts, please dance as you come on stage.

00:13:01.570 --> 00:13:03.190
Lucia's in here, isn't she?

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:05.430
No, you can't come in.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:07.010
No one except for authorized personnel are allowed.

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:09.480
I have something to tell Lucia!

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:10.350
Let me through!

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:11.340
Kaito!

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:13.130
Let go! Let me go!

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:14.900
No! Didn't I say no already!?

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:15.850
Don't bother us anymore!

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:17.130
Lucia!!

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:19.400
Umm, just a little bit...

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.820
For just a little bit, could I speak with Kaito?

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:24.430
Considering that we're going to be late for the photo shoot, it's just not possible.

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:27.400
Come on, let's hurry it up. The photo shoot is about to start.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:29.830
Kaito.

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:11.720
Lucia.

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:13.510
Kaito.

00:15:14.090 --> 00:15:15.510
We shot someone who's not supposed to be in this scene!

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:16.750
Get him out of here, quickly!

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:19.690
Let go of me! Let me see Lucia!

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:21.260
Kaito!

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:34.970
Don't turn around, Lucia.

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:36.110
Kaito.

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:39.110
Since I haven't been able to see you much at all,

00:15:39.110 --> 00:15:41.330
I'm going to disguise myself as an actor to come and meet you.

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:44.920
Kaito... To do something so bold, will you be alright?

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:47.720
It's all because I have something that I have to tell you.

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:51.930
Something you have to tell me?

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:54.710
Let's go, Lucia!

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:04.440
Hey, Kaito. What's this thing that you have to tell me?

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:07.500
I figured it out. Everything...

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:09.320
That you...

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:10.720
That I?

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:13.450
Yes, you...

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:21.400
Dammit, we were followed.

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:24.920
There's no escape.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:26.590
That's right.

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:30.510
W-Why would the Black Beauty Sisters appear here!?

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:32.590
Lucia, let's run for it!

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:35.760
It's Show Time!

00:17:07.820 --> 00:17:09.670
Lucia, let's use that ship to escape.

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:20.720
Hey, Kaito. The thing you were talking about just now.

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:23.640
The thing that you wanted to tell me. What is it?

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:26.650
It's about the mermaid that I met when I was a child.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.260
I've finally realized who that mermaid was...

00:17:31.430 --> 00:17:32.030
What was that?

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:37.660
Pirates!?

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:44.450
Why do the water demons have to attack us!?

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:45.810
Lucia, let's make our getaway!

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:46.460
This way!

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:52.420
Hey, Kaito.

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:56.010
Could you continue with what you were trying to tell me before?

00:17:56.710 --> 00:17:57.360
What's that?

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:04.060
You can't get away from us...

00:18:04.360 --> 00:18:05.140
It can't be.

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:06.520
Let's run for it, Lucia.

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:09.850
Wait right there!

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:16.080
Dammit, it's a dead end.

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:18.410
What are we going to do, Kaito?

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:20.600
We're going to jump, Lucia.

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:23.460
That's totally impossible!

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:24.690
This is no time to hesitate!

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:25.870
Let's go, Lucia!

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:30.920
Owww...

00:18:31.280 --> 00:18:32.730
What's wrong, Lucia?

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:35.890
I know that you're tired, since we're all very busy.

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:38.070
But if you don't pay attention, you'll fall.

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:39.780
The performance will start soon.

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:40.460
Pull yourself together please.

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:43.720
Don't waste your energy needlessly, Lucia-san.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:45.420
Hey, where's Kaito?

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:48.950
Kaito's over to the side, talking with the director.

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:50.400
The director?

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:52.540
So you want to have a talk with Lucia.

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:54.270
It can't be helped.

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:57.210
Well then, how about you fight against the alien in the Colosseum?

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:58.320
If you win, then I'll let you.

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:00.800
Kaito's going to fight against the alien in the Colosseum?

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:02.350
That's absurd.

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:04.730
His opponent is the gigantic alien, you know.

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:06.460
Kaito.

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:09.580
Kaito!

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:14.570
Wait for me.

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:15.750
I'm going to save you, Lucia!

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:25.100
Kaito!

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:29.020
I have to do it, since it's come down to this.

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:30.400
Let's go!

00:19:30.590 --> 00:19:32.300
Legendary Finishing Skill

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:34.310
BIG TSUNAMI!

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:47.950
Are you alright, Lucia?

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:50.660
Thank you for saving me, Kaito.

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:53.170
The energy of the water is slowly increasing.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:55.540
I think I can use this energy to summon a water dragon...

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:56.910
Materialize, water dragon!

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:58.540
Huge!

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:02.130
What is this?

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:03.610
Watch out, Lucia!

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:05.050
Kaito! Quick, get away!

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:08.760
So then, judging from the situation, we're also in danger.

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:09.560
You're right.

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:11.440
Run away!

00:20:12.780 --> 00:20:16.840
Lucia. Now isn't the time to talk, but hear me out.

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:20.370
I have something I have to tell you.

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:21.300
That is...

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:23.610
I love you, Lucia.

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:24.870
Kaito.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:28.280
I also love you very much.

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:30.730
Kaito!!

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:47.050
So it was just a dream.

00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:49.060
Thank goodness it was just a dream.

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:52.350
I thought I was going to die.

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:56.940
Hey, Hanon, Rina. What kind of dreams did both of you have?

00:20:57.410 --> 00:20:59.330
A nightmare.

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:01.230
I had one, too.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:18.670
Good morning, everybody!

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:20.590
What were your first dreams of the new year about?

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:27.080
Who could that be, so early in the morning?

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:30.310
Good morning.

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:33.380
I am Watanabe from the Boni Music Company.

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:37.580
I have come by request of the idol trio my company is about to debut.

00:21:41.490 --> 00:21:42.620
I refuse!

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:43.610
I won't debut!

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:44.630
I'll never do it!

00:21:45.020 --> 00:21:46.490
Sorry to bother you!!

00:21:50.510 --> 00:21:56.790
I only wanted to give them a poster of the idol trio that we're going to debut.

00:22:00.760 --> 00:22:02.910
That's why we need a non-stop battle plan no matter what.

00:22:03.440 --> 00:22:06.170
I hate tasteless battle plans like those the most!

00:22:06.730 --> 00:22:09.470
Victory goes to one who makes the first move.

00:22:09.650 --> 00:22:12.210
You all should shoulder all of the blame.

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:14.310
Isn't that too harsh?

00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:17.890
I didn't have a chance to decide at all!

00:23:49.900 --> 00:24:24.760
Preview

00:23:50.990 --> 00:23:53.890
Big Scoop! Big Scoop!

00:23:53.890 --> 00:23:55.980
What is it? You're making such a ruckus.

00:23:55.980 --> 00:23:59.110
I've spotted the place where Nikora-san is having her date at.

00:23:59.110 --> 00:24:00.030
Date?

00:24:00.030 --> 00:24:01.700
I'm sure it's something with lots of people around.

00:24:01.700 --> 00:24:02.530
It's not that.

00:24:02.530 --> 00:24:04.620
He's a young man who's older than her.

00:24:05.280 --> 00:24:06.380
Really? Who is it?

00:24:06.510 --> 00:24:08.870
He's Maki-san from the beach house.

00:24:08.870 --> 00:24:12.230
Maybe Nikora-san will marry him.

00:24:12.230 --> 00:24:13.170
Marriage!?

00:24:13.830 --> 00:24:16.470
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch:

00:24:16.650 --> 00:24:17.490
Love Among Grown-Ups

00:24:17.490 --> 00:24:19.030
How about an encore?
